{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1762.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"88e10147ba8200aaf34a306837f632a4ebf1db8cab0e46e82c99655363afd3b0","ja":"は～ち……きゅ～う……じゅ～う！\n…………ふぅ。","zh":"八～……九～……十～！\n…………呼。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1762.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"d01c1870e97b4cb63eb0d526eedc924334a879fd873aee66f7b034df7175fbd8","ja":"……翼？　なにやってるの？","zh":"……翼？你在做什么呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1762.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"513e8a6f68758b0c8de1230fbef695d813efc2223bee99668960648cc7eaf04f","ja":"腹筋だよ～！　シックスパックを目指そうかなって。\nほら、ギャップにときめいてもらえそうでしょ？","zh":"练腹肌啦～！我想着要不要练出六块腹肌呢。\n你看，这种反差感感觉会让人心动吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1762.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"5ae2883ef1bf17ce321068a0092caa29096eca528fd68dca424a30d483d90745","ja":"ときめく……のかはわからないけど、\n腹筋するのはいいんじゃない？","zh":"虽然不知道算不算法心动……\n但做仰卧起坐不是挺好的吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1762.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"9fa24e1dc14217d988df9a1f76c3ca217b7f94ba5c9ea21896951dbfb56f090b","ja":"でも、どうして衣装でやってるの？","zh":"不过，为什么是穿着服装做的呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1762.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"bd9e190928baaa7b205da75869eb4b0f1f40703f466f30ee4fe7fe64c4fa88e4","ja":"プロレスコラボの衣装なら、\n気合いが入りそうでしょ？","zh":"要是穿摔角联名服装的话，\n感觉会格外有干劲吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1762.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"79379f4d97edac68ff7a62998a269a9cc8ba55447bce861059a9aee971f1f9a7","ja":"こんな感じで～……\nい～ち……に～い……さ～ん……。","zh":"像这样～……\n一～……二～……三～……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1762.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"f502e98ecf9cf998c5817f3041d5cad26d4a83884308eb5f851f68551bc8e54b","ja":"（へえ、意外と頑張ってる……）","zh":"（哎，比想象中还要努力呢……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1762.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"d37085175b7f385ffdd928c125c6250221d8ee01f3836c5414f269698275021c","ja":"……つ、疲れた～！\nこれを毎日続けるなんて……やっぱり無理っ！","zh":"……好、好累啊～！\n每天都要坚持做这个……果然还是不可能啦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1762.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"be0eecd4105349226847fd05320caa1642602d4db819e0bd82d235d361ec0bf1","ja":"まあ、簡単にはいかないでしょうね……そもそも、\nどうして急に、そんなことしだしたの？","zh":"哎，应该没那么容易吧……话说回来，\n你怎么突然开始做那种事了？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1762.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"fde4958d6e3ea973a9e6c7f80a14ebee49a186f61be222b93247ba9fa76e2f93","ja":"ほら、この前のコラボで一緒だったヒールの人、\nいたでしょ？　闇堂さん。","zh":"你看，之前联动时一起合作过的那个演反派的人，\n不是有吗？　叫闇堂的那位。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1762.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"90bad8fbfa1730d89d77870f5afc9a2d15887793fe877d37c4320f798128e777","ja":"あの人、今SNSでバズッてるんだよ！\nほら、これ見て！","zh":"那个人现在在社交平台上很火哦！\n你看，快看这个！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1762.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"6f230f8fc74e42776aad975d3facb13d0c5a006713ee6e43a916613e52e322bf","ja":"本当だ。ハーブティーを優雅に飲んでいる写真に、\nたくさんコメントがついてる……。","zh":"真的耶。优雅地喝着花草茶的照片下面，\n有好多条评论……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1762.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"abfc418491547dfce1b7247f99f2a7a0812f92ca60adba021d35b87f63e4c631","ja":"「かわいい！」「ギャップにキュンとしちゃう」\n……確かに、プロレスしてる時とすごいギャップね。","zh":"“好可爱！”“这种反差让人怦然心动”\n……确实，和平时打职业摔角时的反差好大呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1762.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"16062b85be0e006f974a7b77e0adecec99ef40f8768add060c540eef7560885c","ja":"でしょ！　だからわたし、モテるには\nギャップがあるといいかもって思ったんだ～！","zh":"对吧！所以我才觉得，想要受欢迎的话\n有反差感可能会不错呢～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1762.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"d6b7fa34fb2d3c8eecf781e8897cb572a497193d3ab5ef87754993de0b5fb075","ja":"それで腹筋してみたんだけど……やっぱ無理！\nねぇ、他にいいギャップがないか、一緒に考えて～！","zh":"所以我就试着做了一下仰卧起坐……果然还是不行！\n呐，还有没有别的反差萌啊，快帮我一起想想～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1762.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"4ab8a4d5f0b32c66da2801ef6cf1053296c70f701928de20130747e3b9f80006","ja":"……ボーカルレッスンをちゃんとしたらね。\nもうすぐ先生が来る時間よ。","zh":"……等好好上完声乐课再说吧。\n老师马上就要来了哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1762.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"03a1dbc1dfdca55705ad60eb98b474aa814d3a44d265740d7455e1ca818fff2f","ja":"ええっ！？　ちょっとは休憩させてよ～！？\n今、腹筋したばっかりなのに～！","zh":"欸欸！？稍微让我休息一下嘛～！？\n我才刚做完仰卧起坐而已耶～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1762.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"47cf529be36be4af0888db53913c2d558e4f08482846d4a1ff82081b056fe32e","ja":"腹筋は歌のレッスンにもなるから、\nちょうどよかったじゃない。ほら、早く準備して。","zh":"腹肌锻炼也能当成练声，\n这不是正好吗。好啦，快点准备。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1762.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"172abe302540a63a3320ff2aad835527814a33037bbe56842a1f6cf183d9561b","ja":"せ、せめて5分だけでも……\nお願い、志保ちゃ～ん！","zh":"起、起码让我多睡5分钟也好……\n拜托了，志保～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
